rooms.desc:
A soft, blue haze is reflected on your clothes and flutters about as
if you were covered with living light. A faint moan comes from the south,
then echoes past you, traversing down the hall until it fades to a hiss.

There is a glow about this room.  You have no idea where the light is coming
from but it basks exerything in a eerie red glow.  Exits lead north, east,
south, and west.
